1. Highest Salary in Each Department

Question:
Display the complete details of the employee(s) who earn the highest salary in each department.

SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT *,
           DENSE_RANK() OVER(
               PARTITION BY Department
               ORDER BY Salary DESC
           ) AS salary_rank
    FROM Employees
) AS d
WHERE salary_rank = 1;
