3. Top 2 Highest-Paid Employees in Each Department

Question:
Display the complete details of the top 2 highest-paid employees in each department.

SELECT ID, Name, Department, Salary
FROM (
    SELECT *,
           ROW_NUMBER() OVER(
               PARTITION BY Department
               ORDER BY Salary DESC
           ) AS row_num
    FROM Employees
) AS d
WHERE row_num <= 2;
4. Salary Rank Within Each Department

Question:
Display every employee along with their salary rank within their department.

If two employees have the same salary, they should receive the same rank, and the next rank should skip accordingly.

SELECT *
FROM (
    SELECT *,
           RANK() OVER(
               PARTITION BY Department
               ORDER BY Salary DESC
           ) AS salary_rank
    FROM Employees
) AS d;
